# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py and check_pack.py, the
# repo-side checks that the demo's shader copies and its list of the logo pack
# still match the plugin's, and crosscheck/, which compares the page's port of
# the CPU half with the plugin's own C++; wrangler would otherwise upload them
# and serve them, which is neither useful nor anybody's business.
tools/
# README.md here is the logo pack's: the release copies it into the download
# beside the logos as "demo logos/README.md". The page carries what a visitor
# needs from it (the invented sponsors, the Resolume marks) in its own words.
README.md
